    "turn_text": "Today's question comes from Robert. Hi, Marcia and Sagar, please find my Firestar review below. My question is, I want to own the libs, but not those libs, the libertarians. I used to class myself as a libertarian, I thought we were putting much thought into it, but gradually over time, with the help of this podcast, I've realized it's an idea and political ideology, but doesn't really work. But I'm terrible at trying to break it down and explain it to my friends. Can you give me two to three simple arguments for why libertarianism is a bad idea? Thanks, Robert from Las Vegas.",
