    "turn_text": "Something a more meta question I have Senator is how did you come to the interest on monopoly and antitrust? You have been interested in this for a long time, actually at the exact same time that much of the conservative movement was turning against Theodore Roosevelt, I would say in the mid 2010s and more you were somebody who was actually advocating for embracing his legacy. So it's not like this is some newly discovered thing. Where does that come from in your own intellectual background?",
