        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Audiences are likely to trust claims made by monopolists less when those claims serve self-interest.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Innovation thrives best under conditions of open access and low barriers to entry.",
