        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker assumes that maintaining market concentration enables disproportionate influence over public discourse and personal data.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that technological platforms inherently possess political influence due to their scale and reach.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts that competitive markets lead to better outcomes than monopolistic structures in the context of digital platforms.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
